+ *        rendering: "Invalid argument"), or the driver did not take every one of them. nvidia-drm
+ *        makes a dumb buffer in video memory, pitch linear, for scanout (nvidia-drm-gem-nvkms-
+ *        memory.c, nv_drm_dumb_create()), which is what a frame-packed mode needs of it.
+ * \param ownMade GBM's own buffers were made and passed their checks
+ * \param ownTaken what the test commits said of them
